s far as I can tell, there is no way to update the `package.json` file based on the lockfile (which does have the information needed).\r\n\r\nMajor versions are bumped less frequently, so this should be fine to update manually.\r\n\r\nOther alternatives would be:\r\n- return to the previous way of running `npm i --save` and `npm i --save-dev` instead (ref: #55730). This might be slightly slower than one `npm i` pass though.\r\n- fetch the latest versions of each package from the registry. Might be even slower\r\n\r\nNOTE: The user has always the alternative to update the versions to their desired ones afterward.\r\n\r\nFixes #56174","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/56177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/56177/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1739669438","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/56174#issuecomment-1739669438","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/56174","id":1739669438,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5nsT--","user":{"login":"adeludedperson","id":83860384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODYwMzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83860384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson","html_url":"https://github.com/adeludedperson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adeludedperson/orgs"